WEBVTT

00:04:00.813 --> 00:04:04.976
So, he came up with this idea
of creating a rebreather,

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.621
with a CO2 scrubber,

00:04:07.645 --> 00:04:11.976
which was basically
a tube from Home Depot,

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.976
with a balloon duct-taped to it,

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.976
that he thought we could put inside of me,

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.976
and somehow be able to circulate
the air and rebreathe

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.566
with this thing in me.

00:04:24.518 --> 00:04:27.976
This is a little hard to watch.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.027
But this is that attempt.